
# ETS Website Review Automation System

## Overview
This system automates the conversion of website URLs from an Excel file into structured Planner tasks, based on defined business rules.

---

## Problem
Manual creation of review tasks is inefficient, inconsistent, and not scalable.

---

## Solution
- Read URLs from Excel in SharePoint
- Apply condition-based filtering
- Create Planner tasks only when required
- Provide a scalable workflow for future AI integration

---

## Data Contract

| Field | Type | Description |
|------|------|------------|
| URL | String | Website page link |
| Upload in Planner | String/Boolean | Controls task creation |

---

## Business Rule

```text
IF Upload in Planner = "Yes"
THEN create Planner task
ELSE skip
